        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 01-Z8, Traditional Half-Round Knobset with Rope Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIt is little details that really make a room shine, and the Half-Round Knob with Rope Rose brings elegance to a classic. This Half-Round Knobset comes with a rope rose that gives it that little something extra. This pairing is great for homes with traditional decor. Choose any of the 5 available finishes. This simple half round knobset is part of Fusion's Elite Collection which features concealed mounting screws. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Elite Collection Half Round Knob with Rope Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance.</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish.</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose cover.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Simple Knobset with Rope Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" to 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass and Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Half-Round Knob with Rope Rose, Fusion 01-Z8",
                "description": "Fusion 01-Z8, Half-Round Knob with Rope Rose - It is little details that really make a room shine, and the Half-Round Knob with Rope Rose brings elegance to a classic. This Half-Round Knobset comes with a rope rose that gives it that little something extra. This pairing is great for homes with traditional decor. Choose any of the 5 available finishes. This simple half round knobset is part of Fusion's Elite Collection which features concealed mounting screws. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n",
